    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "MANILA, Philippines — The Commission on Elections (Comelec) has released the list of winning district representatives in the first Bangsamoro Parliamentary Elections on the afternoon of Sept. 16 (Wednesday)."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM) held its first parliamentary elections on Sept. 14."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "The following elected district representatives are allocated 32 seats in the Bangsamoro parliament."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "BASILAN:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Rima Hassan (BFP) – 1st district",
        "Pai Sali (UBJP) – 2nd district",
        "Abrar Hataman (BFP) – 3rd district",
        "Jay Hataman Salliman (BFP) – 4th district"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "LANAO DEL SUR"
